+        <li><code>Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin</code></li>
+        <li><code>Permissions-Policy</code> disabling sensitive device APIs (camera, microphone, geolocation, payment, USB) and ad-tracking APIs (<code>browsing-topics</code>, <code>interest-cohort</code>, <code>join-ad-interest-group</code>, <code>run-ad-auction</code>, <code>attribution-reporting</code>)</li>
+        <li><code>Content-Security-Policy</code> restricting script, connection, style, and framing sources</li>
+        <li><code>X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff</code>, <code>X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN</code>, <code>Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin</code>, and <code>X-DNS-Prefetch-Control: off</code></li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>6. Managing Your Privacy Preferences</h2>
